-<!DOCTYPE HTML>
-<meta charset="utf-8">
-<link rel="help" href="http://www.w3.org/TR/CSS21/visudet.html#containing-block-details">
-<link rel="help" href="http://www.w3.org/TR/CSS21/visudet.html#abs-non-replaced-width">
